#: ../../source/users/annex/text_font.rst:7
msgid "QElectroTech text font"
msgstr "QElectroTech 文本字体"

#: ../../source/users/annex/text_font.rst:9
msgid "To define the text font at the **Select font** PopUp window:"
msgstr "在 **选择字体** 弹出窗口中定义文本字体的方法："

#: ../../source/users/annex/text_font.rst:11
msgid ""
"Search for the font using the searching box or using the scrollbar from "
"right side."
msgstr "使用搜索框或右侧的滚动条搜索字体。"

#: ../../source/users/annex/text_font.rst:12
msgid "Click on the text font in the list box."
msgstr "在列表框中单击所需的文本字体。"

#: ../../source/users/annex/text_font.rst:13
msgid ""
"Define font size by horizontal scrollbar, defining the size in the text box "
"or using +/- buttons."
msgstr "通过水平滚动条定义字体大小，在文本框中输入大小，或使用 +/- 按钮。"

#: ../../source/users/annex/text_font.rst:18
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech select font PopUp window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 选择字体弹出窗口"
